# QA (M1 Stage 1): a relaxed, curious, imperfect full run at walking speed
# (handwritten, no solver prefix). Busbahnhof: walks under the box row,
# bumps the ?-box from below, climbs onto the brick row and walks over its
# Oblaten, steps. Mirabellgarten: jumps over tourist #1 while it takes a
# selfie, stomps tourist #2, bumps the M-box, eats the Mozartkugel after the
# hedge turns it back (PowerUp), hops the hedge and breaks three planter bricks
# from below as Zuckerschock (tourist #3 knocked out), climbs the Pegasus
# basin and plinth for the Oblaten arc, stomps tourist #4 in the Zwergerl
# trench. Makartsteg: stomps Taube #1 over the deck, walking jumps over the
# four gaps. Getreidegasse: past the checkpoint, back to bump the M-box at
# col 132 as Zuckerschock (points only), stomps a tourist, up onto Z1, a
# running jump enters the Erker from the side under the burger sign (one-way)
# and jumps back out onto the sign, steps off its end (low ceiling) with a
# jump onto Z3, Z4, stomps Verkaeufer #1, walks under the stand. Domplatz:
# hides on the Residenzbrunnen top while the Fiaker charges through, gets hit
# by the stage tourist (Hurt: back to Normal), jumps onto the Jedermann stage,
# waits for the risen Sphaera Taube to pass, over the Sphaera onto the car,
# rides up and takes a running jump to the Wurstkranz (5000).
# 60 of 81 Oblaten, 3900 frames (65 s; ZEIT 237 at the touch).
level  = salzburg
source = handwritten
expect = complete frames=3900..3900 deaths=0 lives=3 state=stage_clear
expect = oblaten>=60 score>=19750
expect = event=PowerUp event=BrickBroken event=CheckpointReached event=Hurt
